{% if wake.reason == "created" %}
The case was just created. Start working on the goal.
{% elif wake.reason == "human_message" %}
The owner sent you a message:

{{ wake.text }}
{% elif wake.reason == "human_answer" %}
The owner answered your question "{{ wake.question }}":

{{ wake.answer }}
{% elif wake.reason == "condition_fired" %}
You were woken up because the condition `{{ wake.kind }}` fired.
{% for detail in wake.details %}
- {{ detail | tojson }}
{% endfor %}
{% elif wake.reason == "timed_out" %}
You were woken up because the wait for `{{ wake.kind }}` timed out before it happened.
{% elif wake.reason == "manual" %}
The owner woke you up. Review the situation and decide what to do next.
{% elif wake.reason == "instructions_changed" %}
The owner {{ wake.change }} the instruction `{{ wake.name }}`. Your instructions show the
current version: check whether it changes what you should do.
{% elif wake.reason == "approval_decided" and wake.decision == "approve" %}
The owner approved your `{{ wake.tool }}` call{{ " with changes" if wake.edited_args else "" }}.{{ (" Their comment: " ~ wake.comment) if wake.comment else "" }} It runs now; its result follows.
{% if wake.edited_args %}
It runs with these arguments instead of yours:
{{ wake.edited_args | tojson }}
{% endif %}
{% elif wake.reason == "approval_decided" %}
The owner rejected your `{{ wake.tool }}` call; it was not run.{{ (" Their comment: " ~ wake.comment) if wake.comment else "" }} Adjust and ask again, or change course.
{% elif wake.reason == "approved_call_finished" %}
The approved `{{ wake.tool }}` call {{ "failed" if wake.is_error else "ran" }}. Result:
{{ wake.result | tojson }}
{% elif wake.reason == "file_added" %}
The owner added a file to the case: `{{ wake.name }}` ({{ wake.kind }}). It is listed under "Files" in
your instructions.
{% endif %}

(Time: {{ now }})
